        "summary": "Static χmT of 1 is 218.58 cm3 K mol−1 at 300 K and falls to 119.07 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K under 1000 Oe, consistent with Dy(III) Stark depopulation and antiferromagnetic coupling. Magnetization reaches 62.22 Nβ at 5 T without saturation and M vs H/T plots do not overlay, indicating magnetic anisotropy. No evident hysteresis at 2 K. Zero-field AC susceptibility of 1 is frequency-independent; QTM is suppressed under 600 Oe. 1 is not an SMM under the reported conditions.",
